WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.720
House Republicans have proposed a

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.179
blueprint for tax reform, under which the

00:00:09.179 --> 00:00:11.130
United States would adopt a system of

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.679
destination-based cash flow taxation at

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.199
the corporate level. What does it mean

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:18.510
for corporate taxation to be destination-based,

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.480
as opposed to origin-based? It means

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.310
that it's the location of the consumer,

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.039
not of the producer, that determines

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:28.140
where the cash flow from a transaction

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.019
is taxed. But the locations of consumer and

00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:33.270
producer often of the same. Herein lies

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.550
the complication if consumption taxation

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.410
takes place at the corporate level, as it

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.210
would under the House plan and under

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.570
value-added tax systems. One has to then exempt the

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:45.720
cash flow from sales to consumers abroad,

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.820
and tax the imports purchased by the

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.829
domestic consumers from overseas

00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:52.559
producers. Now as long as the US runs a

00:00:52.559 --> 00:00:54.510
trade deficit, the revenue from taxing

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.489
imports exceeds the revenue loss from

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.829
not taxing exports, and House Republicans

00:00:58.829 --> 00:01:01.700
like that, because it lets them reduce taxes elsewhere.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.719
And that, in a nutshell, is

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.620
what border adjustment is.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.720
To learn more about my take on border adjustment,

00:01:08.729 --> 00:01:10.439
check the links in the description below.

00:01:10.439 --> 00:01:13.110
